A||N||6||chris6878||85 SE or 85 GT??????????||||
Z||000000||chris6878||09-10-1999||12:35 AM||||Hey Guys and Gals<P>I just bought an 85 GT or 85 SE...<BR>It looks like a GT in the front and rear but it has SE sail Panels...... Maybe someone just changed the sial panels or something...<P>could someone post a pic of an 85 SE and 85 GT and maybe i could tell from that.....  <P>Thanks in advance...<BR>chris||||reg||
Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||09-10-1999||01:21 AM||||The 85 GT has the lower skirts and are painted greyish silver. The 85SE will not have these, unless somebody added them. The SE is actually just a coupe. In 86-87 SEs looked just like the 85GTs except the skirts were painted black instead of grey/silver.||||reg||
Z||000002||chris6878||09-10-1999||10:45 AM||||Thanks SCCA FIERO,<P>My car does have the lower skirts you were talking of. The car has been painted one solid color though. Even the black trim going around the car was painted the same color. Its in need of a paint job. I guess that resolves it then. I guess i will change the sail panels back to the ones with GT on them....<P>thanks.<BR>Chris||||reg||
Z||000003||fastonpumpgas||09-10-1999||12:23 PM||||If you find some good snail panels let me know, the repo ones are way to expensive . I also have an 85 GT I am putting a 3.1 in<BR>||||reg||
Z||000004||batboy||09-11-1999||11:38 AM||||Look at the fifth digit of the VIN. If it's a "F" then it's a SE model, if it's a "G" then it's GT model.||||reg||1
Z||000005||88 Fiero||09-11-1999||11:51 AM||||another way of checking is to take the side signal molding in the front and the side driving light molding of your car... look at the rivets on it... if it looks like it was replace not original looking then it could be an "SE" other than that if it's original rivet then..it's a "GT"...||||reg||5
Z||000006||Voyd||10-30-1999||10:28 AM||||interesting, i have a car that is exactly like that. it has the low GT front, the steering wheel has GT emblems and a GT emblem is on the front of the car. But the side panel windows say SE and a VIN decoder search tells me its an SE.<P>weird...well anyways i find that it still looks killer with that GT front!||||reg||1
